flowchart LR
    DEV[git push /<br/>pull request] --> GA[GitHub Actions]
    GA --> J1[flake8 +<br/>pytest on SQLite]
    GA --> J2[pytest on<br/>PostgreSQL 16]
    GA --> J3[TypeScript check<br/>+ Vite build]
    J1 --> OK{All green?}
    J2 --> OK
    J3 --> OK
    OK -- yes --> R[Render deploys<br/>backend API]
    OK -- no --> STOP[Deploy blocked:<br/>fix first]
    DEV --> V[Vercel builds<br/>frontend]
    R --- DB[(Render<br/>PostgreSQL)]
